# iOS minimum OS and latest SDK

Exact product ship (2026-11-14): shipping IPA floors at Exact
`host.ios.minimumOS` **17.0**. No committed `Wawona.xcodeproj`. Use iPhoneOS
SDK from Xcode 27. Never downgrade the SDK.

Legacy SwiftUI dual-run 15.0 floor is retired with the Xcode project. See
`docs/agent-rules/wawona-ios-min-os.md`.

## Build contract

- Exact `apps/wawona/app.json` `host.ios.minimumOS` = `17.0`.
- `cargo xtask deps get` / `backend` + Exact `bun host/apple/build.mjs`.
- Rust slices may keep a lower archive min; Exact host floor wins for the IPA.
- Mode B tipa/deb: Exact device build + ldid; `Depends: firmware (>= 17.0)`.
- Store bundle id: `com.aspauldingcode.Wawona` (Exact `app.json`).

## Hard rejects

- Reviving a 15.0 product `Wawona.xcodeproj` to "support iOS 15"
- Downgrading the iPhoneOS SDK
- Mixing Mode B ents into ASC Exact IPA
